			"description":"Use the <iphoneStartTrackingHeading> command to start tracking the\ncurrent heading of the device.\n\nThe <iphoneStartTrackingHeading> command starts tracking the heading of\nthe device using the digital compass.\n\nStarting to track the heading may request the user to calibrate the\nmagnetometer. \n\n>*Note:* The digital compass is only supported in iOS 4.0 and later.",
