			"description":"Use the <lock messages> <command> when a <handler> performs an action\n(such as opening a <stack>) and you want to speed up access by\npreventing unnecessary <navigation message|navigation messages> (such as\n<openStack>) from being sent.\n\nThe <lock messages> <command> sets the <lockMessages> <property> to\ntrue. \n\nWhen all pending handlers are finished executing, the <lockMessages>\n<property> is set back to false.",
