			"description":"Use the <mobileStoreDisablePurchaseUpdates> command to disable the\nreceipt of <purchaseStateUpdate> messages.\n\nThe command <mobileStoreDisablePurchaseUpdates> is used to disable the\nreceipt of purchaseStateUpdate messages from the store. This command is\ntypically used in <purchaseStateUpdate> message, after processing each\nmessage that is sent by the store.\n\n>*Note:*  This command is used when interacting with the Apple AppStore,\n> however, we suggest using it for every store. Failure to use this\n> command results in continuing to receive <purchaseStateUpdate>\n> messages from the AppStore.",
