			"description":"Use the put markup command to write a string to stdout that contains\nHTML markup.\n\nUpon output the text is converted to match the setting of the current\n<outputTextEncoding> property, with any unrepresentable characters being\noutput using a decimal character entity reference &#ddddd;.\n\nAdditionally, the internal line ending character 'LF' is transformed on\noutput to match the setting of the <outputLineEndings> property.",
