			"description":"Use the <show cards> <command> to do \"flipbook\"-style animation or to\ndisplay a number of <card|cards> quickly to the user.\n\nThe 'show number cards' form displays the <number> of <card|cards>, \nstarting with the <current card>. \n\nThe 'show all cards' form displays all the cards in the <current stack>, \nstarting and ending with the <current card>.",
