			"description":"Use the <geometricMean> <function> to find the <value(function)> that\nbest represents a group of <value(glossary)|values> for sets of positive\nnumbers that are interpreted according to their product and not their\nsum. \n\nThe <geometricMean> <function> was added in version 6.1 to complement\nthe <average> <function>.\n\nIf the <numbersList> is empty, the <geometricMean> <function> returns\nzero.\n\nIf a math operation on finite inputs produces a non-finite output, an\nexecution error is thrown. See <math operation|math operations> for more\ninformation.",
