			"description":"Use the <hostAddressToName> function to find the <domain name> of the\ncomputer at a <IP address>.\n\nThe <hostAddressToName> <function> does a reverse <DNS> lookup on the\n<IP address> in order to find the <domain name>. This means that the\ncomputer must be connected to the Internet in order to use this\n<function>. If a connection to the Internet is not available, the\n<hostAddressToName> <function> <return|returns> an error message.",
