			"deprecated":"In version 7.0 the language was changed to handle unicode\ntransparently. This means that language functionality which previously\naided unicode text manipulation is no longer required. This function\nshould not be used in new code. measureUnicodeText(tText) is equivalent\nto measureText(textDecode(tText, \"UTF16\" )).",
