			"description":"Use the <openProcesses> <function> to find out which <process|processes>\nneed to be closed, or to check whether a <process> is already running\nbefore communicating with it.\n\nThe list of process names is in the same order used by openProcessIDs\n<function>, which is the same order that the <process|processes> were\nopened. \n\nPrograms that were not started by OpenXTalk are not included in the list\nreturned by the <openProcesses> <function>.",
