			"description":"Use the <version> function to determine whether the <application>\nsupports a particular feature.\n\nThe version number belongs to either the OpenXTalk application (if the\nstack is being used with OpenXTalk) or to the running standalone\napplication. The engine <version> of a <standalone\napplication|standalone> is the same as the <engine> <version> of\nOpenXTalk that was used to create it.",
