			"summary":"Used with the <click>, <play>, and <prepare> <command|commands> to\nspecify a <point> on the screen. Also used with the <read from file>,\n<read from process>, and <write to file> <command|commands> to specify\nwhere to begin reading or writing.",
			"introduced":"1.0",
