			"description":"Use the <black> <keyword> to transition to a blank black <background> in\na sequence of visual effects.\n\nVisual effects can be stacked in a sequence by using several \n<visual effect> <command|commands> in succession. If the last transition \nends with showing the <card>, and all except the last one shows an\nintermediate image (such as a solid black color), the effect is\nenhanced. You show a solid black color at the end of a transition by\nusing the <black> <keyword>.\n\nThis example uses the push effect with the <black> <keyword> to emulate\nan old-fashioned slide projector:\n\n    visual effect push left to black -- from card to solid black\n    visual effect push right to card -- from black to final card\n    go card \"Destination\"",
