			"description":"Use the <recent> <keyword> to refer to the previously-visited <card>.\n\nWhenever you switch cards, unless the lockRecent <property> is set to\ntrue, each <card> you've visited is added to the <recent cards|recent\ncards list>. In <object reference|card references>, the <recent>\n<keyword> specifies the <card> most recently visited.",
