			"description":"Use the <spray can> <keyword> to paint airbrush strokes with the\n<brushColor>. \n\nWhen using the Spray Can tool, the cursor is the shape specified by the\nspray <property> (over stack windows) or an arrow (anywhere else). This\n<tool> is used to brush the <brushColor> (or <brushPattern>) onto an\n<image> in the pattern of the <spray>.\n\nIf you try to paint with the Spray Can tool on a card that has no\nimages, an image object the size of the card is created to hold the\npainting. If the current card already has one or more images, painting\noutside the image has no effect.",
