			"description":"Handle the <resume> <message> if you want to perform some action when\nthe <application> is made active.\n\nThe <resume> <message> is sent whenever the user switches back to the\n<application> from another program.\n\nThe actual switch is not triggered by the <resume> <message>, so\n<trap|trapping> the <message> and not allowing it to <pass> does not\nprevent the user from switching into the <application>.",
