			"description":"Use the <,> <operator> to combine two <string(glossary)|strings> with a\ncomma between them.\n\nThe <,> <operator> is equivalent to  comma <a/>. In other words,\n\n    \"this\" , \"that\"\n\ndoes the same thing as\n\n    \"this\"  comma  \"that\"",
