			"description":"In SuperCard, the <allowFieldRedraw> <property> determines whether\nscrolling <field|fields> are <redraw|redrawn> after scrolling. In\nOpenXTalk, scrolling <field|fields> are always <redraw|redrawn>.\n\nThe <allowFieldRedraw> <property> is always set to false. A <handler>\ncan set it to any value without causing a <error|script error>, but the\nactual <value> is not changed.",
