			"description":"Use the <backgroundPixel> <property> to change the background color of\nan <object(glossary)> when the <bit depth> of the screen is 8 <bit|bits>\n(256 colors) or less.\n\nThe <backgroundPixel> <property> specifies which entry in the <color\ntable> is used for an object's background color. It is similar to the\n<backgroundColor> <property>, but is specified as an entry in the\ncurrent <color table>, rather than as a <color reference>.\n\nThe color table can be set by changing the colorMap <property>.",
