			"description":"On Windows systems the user can define custom colors in the color\ndialog. The <colorDialogColors> provides a way to access the colors the\nuser created in the dialog allowing a program to save them for the next\nsession. \n\nThe colorDialogColors is a list of up to 16 colors. There may be empty\nlines in the list representing an unset color.",
