			"platforms":["desktop","server","mobile"],
			"examples":[{
				"script":"set the dontResize of graphic 12 to true"
			}],
			"value":[{
				"name":"value",
				"type":"bool",
				"description":"The <dontResize> of a <graphic(keyword)> is true or false.\nBy default, the <dontResize> <property> of newly created\n<graphic(object)|graphics> is set to false."
			}],
			"description":"Use the <dontResize> <property> to automatically resize and reposition a\n<graphic(keyword)> when you set its <points> <property>.\n\nYou can reshape a graphic whose <style> <property> is set to polygon by\nchanging its <points> or <relativePoints> <property>.\n\nIf you change the graphic's <points> or <relativePoints> <property>, and\nthe <graphic(object)|graphic's> <dontResize> <property> is set to false,\nthe <graphic(keyword)> is resized and repositioned if necessary to\naccommodate the new shape.\n\nIf you change the <points> or <relativePoints> and the <dontResize> is\nfalse, the <graphic(keyword)> is not resized to fit the new set of\n<vertex|vertexes>. This may result in parts of the shape being cut off\nat the boundaries of the <graphic(keyword)>.",
			"references":{
				"keyword":["polygon","graphic"],
				"property":["points","style","relativePoints"],
				"command":["drag"],
				"object":["graphic"],
				"glossary":["vertex","property"]
			},
