			"description":"Use the <editionType> global property to determine what edition of the\nengine is currently running.\n\nThe global property the editionType can be used to determine what\nedition of the engine is currently running.\n\nThe editionType returns \"community\" if the currently running engine is\nthe OpenXTalk Community IDE or a standalone built with OpenXTalk\nCommunity. \n\nThe editionType returns \"commercial\" if the currently running engine is\nthe OpenXTalk Commercial IDE or a standalone built with OpenXTalk\nCommercial. ",
