			"value":[{
				"name":"value",
				"type":"bool",
				"description":"The <multipleHilites> of a <field(keyword)> is true or false.\nBy default, the <multipleHilites> <property> of newly created\n<field(object)|fields> is set to false."
			}],
			"description":"Use the <multipleHilites> <property> to control the <behavior> of \n<list field|list fields>.\n\nIf the <multipleHilites> of a <field(keyword)> is set to true, the user\ncan <select> more than one line by dragging within the <field(keyword)>,\nor Shift-clicking to <select> all the lines between the <selected> line\nand the clicked line. If the <multipleHilites> is false, clicking a line\ndeselects any other lines in the <field(keyword)>.\n\nIf the field's <listBehavior> <property> is false, the <multipleHilites>\n<property> has no effect.\n\n>*Important:*  Setting the <toggleHilites> to true automatically sets\n> the <field(object)|field's> <multipleHilites> <property> to true.\n> (However, setting the <toggleHilites> to false does not set the\n> <property> back to false.) To set the <toggleHilites> to true and the\n> <multipleHilites> to false, be sure to set the <toggleHilites> first,\n> then set the <multipleHilites> to false.",
