			"description":"Use the <printPaperRectangle> property to find out the rectangle being\nprinted to in device-co-ordinates, taking the printPaperOrientation into\naccount. \n\nThe printPaperRectangle property is read-only and cannot be set.\nChanging the <printMargins> will not affect the <printPaperRectangle>.",
