			"description":"Use the <raisePalettes> <property> to control interleaving of\n<palette|palettes> with other windows.\n\nIf the <raisePalettes> <property> is true, <palette|palettes> float in\ntheir own layer above standard windows. In other words, all\n<palette|palettes> are always in front of <editable window|editable\nwindows> and <modeless dialog box|modeless dialog boxes> if this\n<property> is set to true.\n\nIf it is set to false, palette windows can be interleaved with standard\nwindows. \n\n>*Important:*  Setting this <property> to true may result in window\n> flashing on <Unix|Unix systems>.",
