			"description":"Use the <recording> <property> to determine whether a recording is being\nmade or to stop recording.\n\nThe <recording> <property> is true if sound is currently being recorded\nwith the <record sound> <command>, false if it is not.\n\nIf a recording is currently being made, you can set the <recording>\n<property> to false to stop recording. This is equivalent to using the\n<stop recording> <command>.",
