			"description":"Use the <sharedHilite> <property> to cause a <button(keyword)> (such as\na <radio button> or <checkbox>) to display the same state wherever it is\nshown. \n\nIf a button's <sharedHilite> <property> is set to true, the <hilite>\n<property> of that <button(keyword)> is the same on all\n<card(object)|cards> where the <button(keyword)> appears.\n<highlight|Highlighting> the button on one <card(keyword)>\n<highlight|highlights> it on all of them. If the\n<button(object)|button's> <sharedHilite> is false, it can have a\ndifferent <hilite> <property> on each <card(keyword)> where it appears,\nand <highlighting(glossary)> a button <highlight|highlights> it only on\nthe <current card>.\n\nSet the <sharedHilite> <property> to false for <radio button|radio\nbuttons> and <checkbox|checkboxes> (and for other\n<button(object)|buttons> whose <hilite> is retained to display a setting\nor a state) if the state the <button(keyword)> displays is different for\neach <card(keyword)>.",
