			"description":"Use the <sharedText> <property> to create labels or other\n<field(object)|fields> with static text (the same on all\n<card(object)|cards> where the <field(keyword)> appears).\n\nIf a field's <sharedText> <property> is set to true, the content of that\n<field(keyword)> is the same on all <card(object)|cards> where the\n<field(keyword)> appears. Changing the text on one <card(keyword)>\nchanges it on all the <card(object)|cards>.\n\nIf the field's <sharedText> is false, it can have different text on each\n<card(keyword)> where it appears, and changing the\n<field(object)|field's> text changes it only on the <current card>.\n\nIf the field is a card field (not part of a group), its <sharedText>\n<property> has no effect.",
