			"description":"Use the <startArrow> <property> to place an arrowhead at the starting\n<point> of an irregular <polygon> or line <graphic>.\n\nFor irregular polygons, the start arrow is placed at the point\ncorresponding to the first line of the graphic's points <property>.\n\nIf the style <property> of the <graphic> is not polygon or line, the\nsetting of its <startArrow> <property> has no effect.",
