			"description":"Use the <tool> <property> to check which <tool> is in use before\nperforming an action that depends on the <tool>.\n\nThe tool names are the same as the names used with the <choose>\n<command> to select a <tool> for use.\n\nSetting the <tool> is equivalent to choosing the <tool> with the\n<choose> <command>. When setting the <tool> <property>, you can omit the\nword \"tool\".",
